  "bodyText": "Skip to content\n\nNEW FINS HAVE LANDED 🏄 SHOP NOW \n\nSHOP\nEXPLORE\nCart\nMEET THE TEAM\n\nOur team is made up of the world's best competition, lifestyle, and big-wave surfers. We're stoked to have this amazing bunch of ambassadors traveling around the globe supporting us.\n\nKELIA MONIZ\n\nKelia Moniz is one of the most versatile surfers in the world. She's learned all the basics from carving fluid off the lip or cross-stepping to the nose.\n\nJULIAN WILSON\n\nThe hopes and dreams of Australia’s surfing future rides proudly on the shoulders of this surfer, and his best is yet to come.\n\nSALLY FITZGIBBONS\n\nAt 18, Sally clinched the Qualifying Series championship faster than any other woman in history after tearing through the first five events.\n\nELI HANNEMAN\n\nHawaiian prodigy Eli Hanneman knows exactly what he wants and where’s he’s going. His technique overall is flawless, and there aren’t many who’re better in the air.\n\nMASON HO\n\nOver the past few years Mason’s traveled the world riding and documenting the world’s best waves. His unique content is among the most watched in the industry.\n\nFILIPE TOLEDO\n\nFilipe's an incredible tube rider, an uncompromising competitor, and never one to duck a question in a post-heat interview.\n\nKYUSS KING\n\nHeavy slabs and deep ocean swells have groomed this young lad into one of the most revered tube riding maestros on the planet.\n\nBARON MAMIYA\n\nBaron is a rare surfer that can balance the competition thing and also drop mind-blowing edits that showcase his powerful surfing.\n\nCAROLINE MARKS\n\nCaroline's incredible talent has made her the youngest surfer ever to qualify for the women’s Championship Tour at just 18 years old.\n\nRIDE WITH US\n\nBe the first to know about new collections and exclusive offers.\n\nEmail\nABOUT RIDE\nSTORIES\nRIDE TEAM\nCONTACT\n\nWe find freedom in the waves, and our journey to find those waves is half the fun.\n\nFacebook\nInstagram\nYouTube\nPayment methods\n© 2026, theme-ride-demo Powered by Shopify"
}